                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    754.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Skipping short introductory phrases, underline the first seven or eight words.",
            "block_bbox": [
                80,
                767,
                771,
                818
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 12,
            "group_id": 13,
            "global_block_id": 13,
            "global_group_id": 13,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    80.0,
                    767.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    767.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    818.0
                ],
                [
                    80.0,
                    818.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In most instances,  $ \\underline{\\text{governmental intervention in fast-changing industries leads to}} $ a predictable distortion of market evolution and interference in new product development.",
            "block_bbox": [
                80,
                826,
                742,
                897
            ],
            "block_id": 14,
            "block_order": 13,
            "group_id": 14,
            "global_block_id": 14,
            "global_group_id": 14,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    80.0,
                    826.0
                ],
                [
                    742.0,
                    826.0
                ],
                [
                    742.0,
                    897.0
                ],
                [
                    80.0,
                    897.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In those first words, readers want to see characters not just in the whole subject, as government is implied in governmental, but as the simple subject. Here they aren't.",
            "block_bbox": [
                113,
                903,
                772,
                977
            ],
            "block_id": 15,
            "block_order": 14,
            "group_id": 15,
            "global_block_id": 15,
            "global_group_id": 15,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    113.0,
                    903.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    903.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    977.0
                ],
                [
                    113.0,
                    977.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Find the main characters. They may be objects of prepositions (particularly by and of), possessive nouns or pronouns attached to nominalizations, or only implied. In that sentence, one possible character, industries, is a noun. Another, government, is in the adjective governmental. A third, market, modifies the object of a preposition: of market evolution.",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                985,
                772,
                1114
            ],
            "block_id": 16,
            "block_order": 15,
            "group_id": 16,
            "global_block_id": 16,
            "global_group_id": 16,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    985.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    985.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    1114.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    1114.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Skim the sentence and others around it for actions involving those characters. Look for actions buried in adjectives (predictable  $ \\rightarrow $ predict) and especially in nominalizations: intervention, distortion, evolution, interference, development.",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                1120,
                772,
                1197
            ],
            "block_id": 17,
            "block_order": 16,
            "group_id": 17,
            "global_block_id": 17,
